@baseUrl = http://localhost:8005
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

### Listar categorías
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Bebidas",
  "descripcion": "Gaseosas y jugos"
}

### Obtener categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/categorias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar categoría
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/categorias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Bebidas y snacks"
}

### Cambiar estado categoría
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/categorias/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": 0
}


### Listar productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear producto (con imágenes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----GeoRutaBoundary

------GeoRutaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_categoria"

1
------GeoRutaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nombre"

Coca-Cola 400ml
------GeoRutaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descripcion"

Botella personal
------GeoRutaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="precio"

2500
------GeoRutaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="stock_minimo"

10
------GeoRutaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="imagenes"; filename="producto1.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:\Users\deivyd\Desktop\producto1.png
------GeoRutaBoundary--

### Obtener producto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/productos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar producto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/productos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----GeoRutaBoundary

------GeoRutaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="precio"

2700
------GeoRutaBoundary--

### Cambiar estado producto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/productos/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": 0
}


### Listar inventario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inventario
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agregar stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inventario/agregar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_producto": 1,
  "cantidad": 50,
  "motivo": "Reabastecimiento inicial"
}

### Historial de movimientos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inventario/1/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


